  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_2536.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo se ha celebrado en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a, en Onda, un nuevo mercado de intercambio, organizado por Ecoxarxa Plana Baixa,&nbsp;acompa&ntilde;ada de&nbsp;m&uacute;sica interactiva e improvisaci&oacute;n teatral.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2523.jpg\" alt=\"img_2523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2524.jpg\" alt=\"img_2524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2525.jpg\" alt=\"img_2525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2526.jpg\" alt=\"img_2526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2527.jpg\" alt=\"img_2527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2528.jpg\" alt=\"img_2528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2529.jpg\" alt=\"img_2529\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplanabaixa230214/img_2530.jpg\" alt=\"img_2530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarxaplan